WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.2 · Financial Management
The organisational budget

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Budget for the whole organisation, and plan what you will cut if income falls short.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Include every cost, not only what funders pay for.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Mark income confirmed, likely or possible.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Set it out by month and by objective.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: US$140,000, including a US$10,000 reserve contribution; Foundation A gives 50% and ends next year; the reserve contribution pauses first.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your budget headings, income status and shortfall plan.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
